\\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Flavors\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sweet<br> Salty<br> Bitter<br> Smoky<br> Hot/Spicy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A sugary flavor<br> Tastes too much of salt<br> Strong or unpleasant flavor<br> The taste of smoked wood<br> To make one's mouth burn\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Textures\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Creamy<br> Crunchy<br> Greasy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Smooth, soft and thick<br> A hard texture<br> Tastes of oil\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "This burger has a smoky flavor.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "This Indian curry is so spicy.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "This ice cream is so rich and creamy.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to proofread", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to read and correct written mistakes", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Proofread your work as well when you are done.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le07ob08aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use in a paragraph about food.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "bland", "type": "name"}, {"content": "not interesting or exciting", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The mild ones were too bland.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le07ob08aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "comma", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a punctuation mark , that you use to separate words or groups of words in a sentence", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Capital letters, periods, commas and question marks are very important.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le07ob08aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "spread", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large meal", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There was such a big spread of food at the party.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le07ob08aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "buffet", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a meal for which different foods are placed on a table so that people can serve themselves", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We had an Indian buffet dinner.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le07ob08aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn4le07ob08re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Pronouns One vs. Ones", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use the pronouns <span class = \"strong\">one</span> (singular) and <span class = \"strong\">ones</span> (plural) to replace nouns. You often use demonstratives (<span class=\"italic\">this, that, these, those</span>) with <span class=\"italic\">one</span> and <span class=\"italic\">ones</span>.<br/><br/>Example: <span class = \"italic\">There are two pies. I like <span class = \"strong\">this one</span>. It's an apple pie.</span><br/><br/>You can use them after <span class = \"italic\">Which</span> in questions.<br/><br/>Example:<span class = \"italic\"> Which one</span>? or <span class = \"italic\">Which ones</span>?", "type": "describer"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Interview a friend or family member about their favorite restaurant.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask 5 questions about the different dishes.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use the answers to write a paragraph about their favorite restaurant.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the paragraph aloud. ", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I ask questions about food.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a paragraph about food.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read the paragraph to share my information.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le07ob08re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn4le07ob08re2img02.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn4le07ob08re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "50", "text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-120\">Cooking Instructor</span>: Class, before we finish today, I want to tell you about your homework.<br>"}, {"image": "engenn4le07ob08re2img05.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "4500", "text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-120\">Vanessa</span>: Homework again?"}, {"image": "engenn4le07ob08re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "7500", "text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-120\">Cooking Instructor</span>: Yes ... Vanessa. Tonight you are going to write about your favorite restaurant.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What do we include?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Cooking Instructor</span>: I would suggest that you write at least six sentences and use a lot of description.  Proofread your work as well when you are done. Capital letters, periods, commas and question marks are very important.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Anything else?"}, {"image": "engenn4le07ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 4, "time": "30250", "text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-120\">Cooking Instructor</span>: I want you to compare the different dishes they offer. Dishes from Northern India have a careful mixture of spices.  For example, I preferred the spicy curry. The mild ones were too bland. The spicy one was delicious.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I went to an Indian restaurant last night. Can I write about their dishes? What a spread!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Cooking Instructor</span>: Absolutely! Did you remember many of the items on the menu?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Not really ... I spent my time at the buffet. <br>"}], "coverimg": "engenn4le07ob08re2img02.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "", "id": 1, "time": "17000", "text": "<span class = \"bullet\">What does Vanessa write about?</span>"}, {"image": "", "id": 2, "time": "72000", "text": "<span class = \"bullet\">How does she structure her paragraph?</span>"}], "video_src": "engenn4le07ob08re3vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "video", "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can write about food and customs.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can make suggestions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can use one and ones.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Do you always complete your homework? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Do you think homework is important? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Writing Spot: Do I have to do my homework?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}